5f67><div class=\"label-container\" data-v-0fbb5f67><span class=\"label-wrap\" data-v-0fbb5f67><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium\" data-v-0fbb5f67>Back to News</span></span></div></div></a><span data-component=\"tag\" data-force-active=\"false\" class=\"span-tag\" data-v-4490f3fb data-v-a9cd5498><span class=\"label-container\" data-v-a9cd5498><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium label\" data-v-a9cd5498>Press</span></span></span><h1 class=\"header-title xxl-18 xl-18 lg-20 md-22 sm-12 xs-14 -mix-title-3\" data-v-4490f3fb>Winter at the door? Delta Cafés warms the season with new cappuccinos</h1><h2 class=\"header-info\" data-v-4490f3fb><span class=\"-mix-text-2-regular\" data-v-4490f3fb>Posted</span><time class=\"-sans-text-3-medium\" datetime=\"2025-11-03\" data-v-4490f3fb>2025-11-03</time><svg class=\"em-dash\" width=\"16\" height=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 3\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-v-4490f3fb><path d=\"M0.152344 0.820007H15.8483V2.18001H0.152344V0.820007Z\" fill=\"#35221A\" data-v-4490f3fb></path></svg><span class=\"-mix-text-2-regular\" data-v-4490f3fb>Time to Read</span><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium\" data-v-4490f3fb>1m </span></h2><figure data-component=\"figure\" style=\"--width:600px;--width-rs:max(78.0000px, calc(-77.4046px + 39.8473vw));\" class=\"left header-figure\" data-v-4490f3fb data-v-aa0c7ef8><img width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-nuxt-img onerror=\"this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)\" data-component=\"image-asset\" alt=\"Rita Nabeiro, from Grupo Nabeiro-Delta Cafés\" fetchpriority data-v-aa0c7ef8 src=\"/assets/images/0d6436db6bec2b075a98715fdb7c42f8a22b993c-1200x630-7792ddd7c4.jpg\"><figcaption data-v-aa0c7ef8><p class=\"source\" data-v-aa0c7ef8><span class=\"-mix-text-2-regular\" data-v-aa0c7ef8>Source </span><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium\" data-v-aa0c7ef8>Inês Freire, Brand Images</span></p></figcaption></figure></div></div><main data-v-84023241><div data-component=\"article-body\" data-v-84023241 data-v-9d6634a8><div class=\"article-body align-center\" data-v-9d6634a8><div class=\"article-content\" data-v-9d6634a8><h4>Under the motto “Made in a minute, loved in a second”, Delta offers an experience designed for everyday rhythms, combining convenience and flavour.</h4><p>Delta Cafés has just announced the launch of two new Cappuccino recipes – Classic and Intense, reinforcing the brand’s commitment to the specialty instant segment.</p><p>According to the brand, quoted in a press release sent to newsrooms, the new products “combine the quality and trust of Delta with the simplicity of quick preparation”, making them suitable “to enjoy at any time of day”. Cappuccino Classic has a creamy, smooth profile, while Cappuccino Intense stands out for its stronger notes.</p><p>In the same statement, Delta stresses that the specialty instant coffee market “has recorded significant growth”, driven by consumers’ demand for variety and convenience.</p><div data-component=\"body-quote\" _key=\"dbbe43c6dd08\" _type=\"quote\" data-v-7fa31d65><svg class=\"quote-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 32\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-v-7fa31d65><path d=\"M0 32V17.6378L9.09609 0H14.605L7.94306 17.6378H15.1174V32H0ZM20.8826 32V17.6378L29.9786 0H35.4875L28.8256 17.6378H36V32H20.8826Z\" fill=\"#35221A\" data-v-7fa31d65></path></svg><p class=\"quote-text -mix-headline-1-regular\" data-v-7fa31d65>“Delta is a brand that stays close to its consumers and pays attention to the evolution and trends in hot beverage consumption. The new range of cappuccinos offers an experience of unique indulgence and flavour.”</p><div class=\"quote-info\" data-v-7fa31d65><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium\" data-v-7fa31d65>Mónica Oliveira</span><span class=\"-mix-label-2\" data-v-7fa31d65>Marketing and Communication Director of Grupo Nabeiro-Delta Cafés</span></div></div><p>With this launch, the company aims to respond to different consumption profiles, while maintaining its focus on innovation and on diversifying its offer.</p><figure data-component=\"figure\" style=\"--width:600px;--width-rs:max(78.0000px, calc(-77.4046px + 39.8473vw));\" class=\"left\" _key=\"0ea582b7bafa\" _type=\"image\" data-v-aa0c7ef8><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-nuxt-img onerror=\"this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)\" data-component=\"image-asset\" alt=\"Image\" fetchpriority data-v-aa0c7ef8 src=\"/assets/images/f35e046986f224bff4d9314220fb197e82bbac54-1200x1200-051d116f8d.webp\"></figure><a href=\"https://www.thedeltahouse.com/cappuccino-classic-delta-cafes-241500/p\" target=\"_blank\" data-size=\"medium\" data-component=\"button\" aria-label=\"Classic Cappuccino\" class=\"\" _key=\"b9a56fc359d4\" _type=\"button\" data-v-0fbb5f67><span class=\"bg full\" data-v-0fbb5f67></span><div class=\"icon-wrapper arrow-top-right\" data-v-0fbb5f67><span class=\"icon-container arrow-top-right\" data-v-0fbb5f67><div data-component=\"icon\" class=\"xsmall arrow-top-right\" data-v-0fbb5f67 data-v-8c9deb48><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" data-v-8c9deb48><path fill=\"#35221A\" d=\"m9.983 10.155-.396-5.676-5.675-.422v-1.03l7.18-.052-.066 7.193zm.528-5.702-7.814 7.814-.924-.924 7.814-7.814z\"></path></svg></div></span><span class=\"icon-container ghost arrow-top-right\" data-v-0fbb5f67><div data-component=\"icon\" class=\"xsmall arrow-top-right\" data-v-0fbb5f67 data-v-8c9deb48><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" data-v-8c9deb48><path fill=\"#35221A\" d=\"m9.983 10.155-.396-5.676-5.675-.422v-1.03l7.18-.052-.066 7.193zm.528-5.702-7.814 7.814-.924-.924 7.814-7.814z\"></path></svg></div></span></div><div class=\"label-outer\" data-v-0fbb5f67><div class=\"label-container\" data-v-0fbb5f67><span class=\"label-wrap\" data-v-0fbb5f67><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium\" data-v-0fbb5f67>Classic Cappuccino</span></span></div></div></a><h2></h2><figure data-compon